<title>USA: Alliance starts Phase 2 trials for Imagent.</title>
<headline>Alliance starts Phase 2 trials for Imagent.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO, Calif. 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alliance Pharmaceutical Corp said it began a Phase Two clinical trial in the U.S. of Imagent.</p>
<p>The company is in the process of developing Imagent as a product to aid in the assessment of cardiac function and heart muscle perfusion, and to improve the detection of organ lesions and blood flow abnormalities.</p>
<p>It said Phase One clinical trials showed Imagent was well-tolerated and showed contrast enhancement of cardiac, abdominal and vascular structures at all doses.</p>
</text>
